## 2) Vendormod mirror config

In:

`/mnt/data1/nix/vendor/rust/cargo2nix/submodules/cargo-clean/tools/cargo-vendormod/`

I found a few config files relevant to mirrors.

### Key mirror config file
#### `global_graph/cargo_mirror_config.toml`
This is the clearest mirror-rewrite config. It redirects specific upstream git URLs to a local bare-repo directory:

```toml
# Cargo mirror config — replaces git sources with local submodule repos
# Place in project_root/.cargo/config.toml

[source."file:///home/mdupont/git/github.com/meta-introspector/zkperf.git"]
git = "file:///mnt/data1/nix/vendor/rust/cargo2nix/submodules/cargo-clean/tools/cargo-vendormod/global_graph/bare_repos/zkperf.git"
replace-with = "local-mirror"

[source."https://github.com/dioxus-community/dioxus-charts.git"]
git = "file:///mnt/data1/nix/vendor/rust/cargo2nix/submodules/cargo-clean/tools/cargo-vendormod/global_graph/bare_repos/dioxus-charts.git"
replace-with = "local-mirror"

[source."https://github.com/meta-introspector/syn-serde-rust"]
git = "file:///mnt/data1/nix/vendor/rust/cargo2nix/submodules/cargo-clean/tools/cargo-vendormod/global_graph/bare_repos/syn-serde-rust.git"
replace-with = "local-mirror"

[source."https://github.com/meta-introspector/erdfa-publish.git"]
git = "file:///mnt/data1/nix/vendor/rust/cargo2nix/submodules/cargo-clean/tools/cargo-vendormod/global_graph/bare_repos/erdfa-publish.git"
replace-with = "local-mirror"

[source."https://github.com/meta-introspector/erdfa-publish.git#cc5e7c6b0f0332dd391a898423fffc6455ce205c"]
git = "file:///mnt/data1/nix/vendor/rust/cargo2nix/submodules/cargo-clean/tools/cargo-vendormod/global_graph/bare_repos/erdfa-publish.git"
