### Relevant operational note
The repo also has a scanner script that expects mirrors under a host/owner/repo layout:

- default mirrors dir: `"$HOME/git/host"`
- clone target pattern: `"$MIRRORS_DIR/$host/$owner/${repo}.git"`

So the overall mirror layout is definitely host-bucketed.

